License: LGPL-2.1-or-later

Backported to CodeWeavers CrossOver 26.3.0 FOSS sources.
Port adaptations retain CrossOver HALOutput and PE-owned timer threads.
Apply the complete ordered patch set; shared Unix ABI and all audio tables
must be updated together. See docs/SPATIAL_AUDIO.md for provenance.

Native output adaptation preserves CoreAudio descriptions, coordinates and
channel order, including 5.1.2 top-middle speakers; generation and listeners
track native layout changes.

